The '''Dog Blade''', also known as '''The Sword Of The Brat''', is a {{Mythical}} [[sword]] (LIMITED).

It is primarily considered a meme weapon, but it still has PvP potential and deals moderate to high damage.

==Obtainment Methods==
The Dog Blade was obtainable during the [[Events#Dog House Event 2026|Dog House Event]]. During the event, players could defeat a boss to obtain a [[Love Letter (Item)|Love Letter]], which could be opened like a gift and had a chance of rewarding a voucher for either the Dog Blade or its '''Rabid''' skin. Redeeming the voucher grants the player the respective weapon.

===Trading===
The player is also able to obtain this sword through trading with other players as the sword is not redeemed until redeeming the voucher from the [[Love Letter (Item)|Love Letter]].

===Rabid Skin===
The '''Rabid''' skin is a white-colored version of the Dog Blade, similar to the [[Slayer Skin]] of the [[Dark Blade]]. Redeeming a '''Rabid''' skin voucher will grant the player both items regardless of whether or not they've owned a normal Dog Blade previously. (Owning one previously grants them a redeemable voucher for a normal Dog Blade, and redeems the skin.)

==Upgrading==
The Dog Blade cannot be upgraded and can only be enchanted using [[Common Scroll]]s, just like any other non-upgraded weapon.

