==Trivia==
* The Dog Blade is the third sword to have customizable skins, the first being [[Dark Blade]] and the second being [[Triple Dark Blade]].
* The Dog Blade is the only sword to have a different name when obtaining [[mastery]], called "The Sword of the Brat" rather than "Dog Blade."[[File:Dog Blade Mastery Name.png|thumb|Image of the mastery sword name.]]
* The Dog Blade is the only sword to have a [[transformation]].
* The Dog Blade is one of the 3 unobtainable swords, the other two being [[Triple Dark Blade]] and [[Fishing Trophy]].
* The {{Ability|X}} is the second ability that makes the user invisible to [[Instinct]], the first being [[Portal]]'s {{Ability|Portal|X}}.
* The Dog Blade is one of the two [[Swords]] that cannot be [[Upgrading|upgraded]], alongside [[Fishing Trophy]].
* While using {{Ability|X}}, all in-game chat typed by the user will change to match the [[Dog House (Indra)|Dog House]].
* If the player uses [[Races|v3]] during {{Ability|Z}}, the old v3 visual effect will appear alongside the current one.
* The Dog Blade {{Ability|X}} transformation stacks with [[Buddha]] transformation.
* The Rabid Skin is the only skin in the game that changes how an item functions, making the {{Ability|X}} transformation last indefinetly.
* The Dog Blade is the second sword to be tradable, the first being [[Dark Blade]].
* The {{Ability|Z}} can make the user clip through walls similarly to '''Flash Step''', if the user has a clear line of sight between their starting location and the cursor.
* It is a joke [[Swords|sword]], similar to the joke [[Blox Fruits|fruit]], [[Meme]]. (Both are limited)
* The '''Rabid skin''' of the Dog Blade is sometimes considered a [[Mutations|Mutation]] due to its changed {{Ability|X}}.

